---
const appUrl = "https://nextdo-cew.pages.dev";
const sourceUrl = "https://github.com/nextdo-app/nextdo";
const features = [
  {number:"01",en:"CAPTURE",title:"想到了，就先记下来。",desc:"把突然出现的想法、任务和琐事放进收集箱。无需立刻规划，让大脑回到正在做的事。",icon:"✳"},
  {number:"02",en:"CLARIFY",title:"把模糊变成明确。",desc:"跟随 GTD 厘清向导，把「有空再做」转化为可以真正执行的下一步行动。",icon:"◎"},
  {number:"03",en:"ENGAGE",title:"一次，只专注一件事。",desc:"根据场景和可用时间，聚焦当前最值得完成的事，而不是在长长的清单里反复犹豫。",icon:"◉"}
];
const steps=[["01","收集","捕捉脑海中的每一件事"],["02","厘清","判断它是否可行动"],["03","组织","安排合适的场景与项目"],["04","回顾","定期更新、保持可信"],["05","执行","专注眼前的下一件事"]];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f7f7f3" />
    <meta name="description" content="Nextdo 是开源、本地优先的 GTD 任务管理应用。快速收集、清晰厘清，专注值得做的下一步行动。" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Nextdo — 少一点计划，多一点行动" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="开源、本地优先的 GTD 任务管理工具。" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css" />
    <title>Nextdo — 少一点计划，多一点行动</title>
  </head>
  <body id="top">
    <header class="site-header wrap">
      <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="Nextdo 首页"><span class="mark">✳</span>nextdo<span class="dot">.</span></a>
      <nav aria-label="主导航"><a href="#features">产品亮点</a><a href="#workflow">使用方式</a><a href={sourceUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a></nav>
      <a class="nav-cta" href={appUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">打开 Nextdo ↗</a>
    </header>
    <main>
      <section class="hero wrap">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <div class="eyebrow"><span></span> YOUR NEXT ACTION, MADE CLEAR</div>
          <h1>少一点计划。<br /><em>多一点行动。</em></h1>
          <p>待办事项不该成为新的负担。Nextdo 将 GTD 的思考流程变得简单，帮你收集想法、厘清任务，并找到此刻真正值得做的下一件事。</p>
          <div class="buttons"><a class="btn primary" href={appUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">免费开始使用 ↗</a><a class="btn secondary" href={sourceUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看源代码 ↗</a></div>
          <div class="benefits"><span>✓ 开源免费</span><span>✓ 本地优先</span><span>✓ 浏览器可用</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-art">
          <div class="mock-window">
            <div class="mock-side"><strong>✳ nextdo.</strong><span class="selected">◉　当下</span><span>▤　收集箱</span><span>▦　下一步</span><span>▧　项目</span><small>专注每一个当下。</small></div>
            <div class="mock-main"><div class="mock-meta">今天 · 你的行动空间 <b>◌</b></div><h2>今天，从这里开始。</h2><p>不要急着完成所有事，先做好这一件。</p><div class="tiny-label">●　现在最值得做的</div><div class="mock-task"><small>建议的下一步 <span>专注 25 分钟</span></small><h3>整理下一阶段的项目计划</h3><p>个人成长 · 约 25 分钟</p><div class="mock-task-foot">专注这一件就好 <b>开始 ↗</b></div></div><div class="mock-progress"><span>今天的进展</span><b>2 / 5</b></div><div class="bar"><span></span></div><div class="mock-row">◯　回复项目相关邮件 <small>10 分钟</small></div><div class="mock-row">◯　阅读 15 分钟 <small>15 分钟</small></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="mock-caption">产品界面概念示意 · 非实际截图</div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <div class="manifesto"><div class="wrap">CAPTURE <b>收集</b><i></i> CLARIFY <b>厘清</b><i></i> ORGANIZE <b>组织</b><i></i> ENGAGE <b>执行</b></div></div>
      <section class="section wrap" id="features"><div class="section-lead"><span class="kicker">MADE FOR CLARITY</span><h2>从想到，到做到。<br /><em>每一步都更轻松。</em></h2><p>真正的效率不是管理更多的清单，而是减少每一次「接下来做什么」的犹豫。</p></div><div class="feature-grid">{features.map(feature=><article class="feature"><div class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">{feature.icon}</div><small>{feature.number} / {feature.en}</small><h3>{feature.title}</h3><p>{feature.desc}</p></article>)}</div></section>
      <section class="workflow" id="workflow"><div class="wrap workflow-grid"><div><span class="kicker">SIMPLE BY DESIGN</span><h2>一个自然的流程，<br />让行动更容易。</h2><p>从收集、厘清，到组织、回顾与执行。你只需要从第一步开始。</p><a class="inline-link" href={sourceUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">了解 Nextdo 的设计理念 ↗</a></div><ol>{steps.map(step=><li><span>{step[0]}</span><strong>{step[1]}</strong><small>{step[2]}</small></li>)}</ol></div></section>
      <section class="opensource wrap"><div class="open-symbol">✳</div><div><span class="kicker">BUILT TO STAY YOURS</span><h2>你的任务，<br />理应由你掌控。</h2><p>Nextdo 开源，以本地数据为中心设计。断开网络，也能继续管理自己的生活。</p><a class="inline-link" href={sourceUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看 GitHub 源代码 ↗</a></div><div class="open-tags"><strong>Local-first</strong><span>以本地数据为中心</span><strong>Open source</strong><span>开源透明，欢迎共建</span></div></section>
      <section class="callout wrap"><span class="kicker">THE NEXT STEP IS SIMPLE</span><h2>你的下一步，<br />从这里开始。</h2><p>不必把一切都想好。打开 Nextdo，先记下第一件事。</p><a class="btn light" href={appUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">立即体验 Nextdo ↗</a></section>
    </main>
    <footer class="wrap footer"><a class="brand" href="#top"><span class="mark">✳</span>nextdo<span class="dot">.</span></a><span>为真正重要的事，留出更多空间。</span><div><a href={sourceUrl}>GitHub ↗</a><a href={appUrl}>打开应用 ↗</a></div><small>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Nextdo · MIT License</small></footer>
  </body>
</html>